@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam defaultFontName Tahoma
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #A54A2E
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFF9EE
skinparam classBorderColor #173A45
skinparam actorBorderColor #173A45
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F2E6D4
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #A54A2E
title Order state diagram - role-limited transitions
[*] --> RECEIVED : Customer places valid order
RECEIVED --> PREPARING : Kitchen staff starts preparing
PREPARING --> READY : Kitchen staff finishes preparing
READY --> SERVED : Service staff confirms serving
SERVED --> [*]
note bottom of SERVED
Terminal state. Skips and reverse transitions are rejected.
end note
@enduml
